# Readme

## IMPORTANT - read before running Shadow!

- Your lyrebird binary needs to be located in `/usr/local/bin/lyrebird`, or else
  you need to update the path specified in
  `shadow.data.template/hosts/client/splitpt-config.toml` before running shadow.

- Make sure `splitpt-client` and `splitpt-server` are in your default path.

## Run Shadow

```
shadow \
    --model-unblocked-syscall-latency=true \
    --template-directory=shadow.data.template \
    shadow.yaml \
    > shadow.log
```

## Did it work?

The client's downloads should result in `stream-success` messages:

    cat shadow.data/hosts/client/tgen.1022.stdout | grep stream-success

There are problems if you see any `stream-error` messages:

    cat shadow.data/hosts/client/tgen.1022.stdout | grep stream-error
    cat shadow.data/hosts/serer/tgen.1000.stdout | grep stream-error
